  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Vegan</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cruelty-Free</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><b>What it is: </b>A limited-edition double-ended brush with two versatile brush heads for flawless makeup application, available exclusively for Holiday 2026.<b><br><br>Brush Formulation:</b> Powder<br><br><b>Brush Coverage:</b> Buildable<br><b><br>Bristle Type:</b> Synthetic<br><br><b>Ingredient Callouts:</b> It is vegan and cruelty-free.<br><br><b>What Else You Need to Know:</b> The perfect complement to Hourglass’s Ambient Lighting Edit Unlocked Palettes, these exclusive brushes feature charms created by French jewelry designer Lauren Rubinski. WISH features a four-leaf clover charm, LUCK features an upside-down horseshoe charm, and HOPE features a heart charm. Made for flawless makeup application, the brush boasts two custom-developed brush heads: a slanted end th</div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><b>Suggested Usage:<br></b>-The slanted end is ideal for applying blush and bronzer, while the domed, tapered end seamlessly blends highlighter.<br><br>Cleaning Instructions:<br>-Gently clean brush with mild soap and water.<br>-Lay flat to dry.<br><br><b>Recycling Instructions:<br></b>-Carton is made from FSC-certified paper and is widely recyclable. </div></details>",
  "description_html": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Vegan</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cruelty-Free</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><b>What it is: </b>A limited-edition double-ended brush with two versatile brush heads for flawless makeup application, available exclusively for Holiday 2026.<b><br><br>Brush Formulation:</b> Powder<br><br><b>Brush Coverage:</b> Buildable<br><b><br>Bristle Type:</b> Synthetic<br><br><b>Ingredient Callouts:</b> It is vegan and cruelty-free.<br><br><b>What Else You Need to Know:</b> The perfect complement to Hourglass’s Ambient Lighting Edit Unlocked Palettes, these exclusive brushes feature charms created by French jewelry designer Lauren Rubinski. WISH features a four-leaf clover charm, LUCK features an upside-down horseshoe charm, and HOPE features a heart charm. Made for flawless makeup application, the brush boasts two custom-developed brush heads: a slanted end th</div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><b>Suggested Usage:<br></b>-The slanted end is ideal for applying blush and bronzer, while the domed, tapered end seamlessly blends highlighter.<br><br>Cleaning Instructions:<br>-Gently clean brush with mild soap and water.<br>-Lay flat to dry.<br><br><b>Recycling Instructions:<br></b>-Carton is made from FSC-certified paper and is widely recyclable. </div></details>",
